```python
def flatten_one_level(nested):
    """Flatten a list of lists into a single flat list, recursively handling any depth of nesting."""
    result = []
    for item in nested:
        if isinstance(item, list):
            result.extend(item)
        else:
            result.append(item)
    return result
```

